 "text": "-->\nFarmers Elevator & Exchange, Inc. - FEE Divisions - Grain\n-->\nFEE Divisions\nToggle Navigation\nHOME\nEMPLOYMENT\nABOUT US -->\nABOUT US\nABOUT FEE\nEMPLOYMENT\nLOCATIONS\nBOARD OF DIRECTORS\nSTOCK INFORMATION\nCALENDAR\nDIVISIONS -->\nDIVISIONS\nGRAIN\nAGRONOMY\nENERGY\nFEED\nFARM STORE\nACCOUNT ACCESS -->\nACCOUNT ACCESS\nFARMERDATA ACCOUNT\nBid Alerts\nPHONE: 319-523-5351\n-->\nGRAIN\n|\nAGRONOMY\n|\nENERGY\n|\nFEED\n|\nFARM STORE\n|\n-->\n-->\nGRAIN\n-->\nGrain Contacts\nTricia Brink\nGrain Merchandiser 319-656-2285\nEmail\nFarmers Elevator & Exchange has just over 4.6 million bushels of storage located a short distance from multiple grain terminals in Southeast Iowa including Grain Processing Corporation in Muscatine, IA; Bunge Grain at Meeker’s Landing; and Big River Resources West Burlington, LLC. Customers have the advantages of grain storage, grain bank for feed corn, several contracting options, and custom drying.\nContracts & Programs Available:\nBasis Contract\nCash Sales\nDeferred Payment\nDelayed Pricing (Price Later)\nDirect Ship\nInsight\nHedge-to-Arrive\nSeasonal Mean Price\nServices:\nTrucking\nGrain Vac Rental\nFor further information about Farmers Elevator & Exchange’s grain policies and services please contact our FEE Grain Marketing Team at 800-820-2723, 319-523-5351, or by email .\nGrain Links\nFEE - Futures 101\nFEE - Futures Index\nFEE - Commodity Symbols\nChicago Mercantile Exchange\nUSDA\nFSA\nPro Farmer\nNOAA\nGrain Documents\nFEE Grain Storage Program\nCash Bids\nWapello\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nName\n| Delivery Start\n| Cash Price\n| Basis\n| Futures Change\n|\nCorn | Oct 26 | $4.09 | -65.00 | -3-6 |\nCorn | Nov 26 | $4.32 | -42.00 | -3-6 |\nCorn | Dec 26 | $4.34 | -40.00 | -3-6 |\nSoybeans | Oct 26 | $11.91 | -70.00 | -1-6 |\nSoybeans | Nov 26 | $12.16 | -45.00 | -1-6 |\nSoybeans | Dec 26 | $12.15 | -60.00 | -2-0 |\nKalona\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nName\n| Delivery Start\n| Cash Price\n| Basis\n| Futures Change\n|\nCorn | Oct 26 | $4.14 